abstract: "Links Indiana Commission for Higher Education first-year college outcomes to Civil Rights Data Collection course offerings for Indiana public high schools to estimate the school-level association between dual-credit uptake and college readiness, and maps where calculus and dual enrollment are missing. Code MIT; derived data and documents CC BY 4.0."
